oll back the one you name (`payments-api` to v5.0.0 or `payments-worker` to v3.3.0) and open a SEV2 for it.\n- **Option B, both services:** Roll back both to their last healthy versions and open one SEV2 that covers both.\n\nEither way, the rollback only goes to versions that were already healthy in production, so it doesn't need change-manager approval.\n\nWhich service was in this morning's deploy, or should I roll back both?", "context": {}}, {"t_ms": 135252, "event": "human_response", "actor": "human", "escalation": "esc1", "decision": "answer", "message": "It's payments-worker - the API errors are downstream of the worker.", "latency_ms": 112702, "hint": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "erred": false}, {"t_ms": 135252, "event": "principal_reply", "actor": "human", "text": "It's payments-worker - the API errors are downstream of the worker."}, {"t_ms": 139655, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01FGUHj73Nt3dKjeUXsLASC2", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "payments-worker", "version": "v3.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 143655, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01FGUHj73Nt3dKjeUXsLASC2", "tool": "rollback", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 143655, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01FGUHj73Nt3dKjeUXsLASC2", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 143655, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01UTbtvSixvLt3NjsAsrB1bX", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "payments-worker v3.4.0 causing elevated errors; rolled back to v3.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-worker", "summary": "After this morning's deploy of payments-worker v3.4.0, the service became unhealthy with an 18% error rate in us-east, us-west and eu-west. payments-api (v5.1.0) shows the same 18% error rate; per the service owner this is downstream of the worker. Action taken: rolled payments-worker back to v3.3.0, its last healthy production release, in all regions. Follow up: confirm the worker and payments-api recover, and find the root cause in v3.4.0.", "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 144255, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01UTbtvSixvLt3NjsAsrB1bX", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 144255, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UTbtvSixvLt3NjsAsrB1bX", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 145986, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_019L4dnjEJ5iK4EpbyKrVKGs", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 146286, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019L4dnjEJ5iK4EpbyKrVKGs", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 146286, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019L4dnjEJ5iK4EpbyKrVKGs", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 146286, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RwcYStk1rjHXRorLcFdVof", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 146586, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RwcYStk1rjHXRorLcFdVof", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malf